        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Alongside these emerging opportunities, we continue to grow our business and opportunities among the developers of application storage solutions while also continuing to service our foundational use cases including media and entertainment and cyber resilience.",
        "start_character": 2867,
        "end_character": 3127
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our Backblaze Storage Cloud platform, we deliver two primary services, B2 Cloud Storage and Computer Backup, which are designed to enable customers to store, use, and protect their data in flexible and cost-effective ways.",
        "start_character": 6420,
        "end_character": 6650
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide cloud services through a purpose-built, web-scale software infrastructure built on commodity hardware.",
        "start_character": 581,
        "end_character": 694
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Finally, we continue to invest in our self-serve user base, where developers who are experimenting with AI can experiment and grow within our storage platform.",
        "start_character": 3128,
        "end_character": 3287
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a high-performance cloud storage platform for data-intensive use cases in the artificial intelligence (“AI”) era and across a broad range of modern cloud workloads, designed to help customers address complex storage needs by reducing the barriers of lock-in, complexity, and cost.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 313
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are investing in a number of initiatives that reduce friction for developers building businesses with AI- and other data-intensive workloads, while reinforcing our positioning as a high-performance, cost-effective, open cloud storage provider.",
        "start_character": 16663,
        "end_character": 16909
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that continued investment in developing performance optimization, efficiency improvements, operational support, and other software innovation enhances our ability to efficiently leverage hardware and scale cost-effectively.",
        "start_character": 4295,
        "end_character": 4529
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We sell B2 Cloud Storage to resellers at a discounted rate.",
        "start_character": 14177,
        "end_character": 14236
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As a result, even if a few of the parts are entirely lost or offline, we are able to reconstruct the customer data from the remaining parts for durability and availability.",
        "start_character": 5200,
        "end_character": 5372
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016395-679338ddc035ed7f",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016395",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As we move up-market, we expect our direct sales activities to increasingly contribute to the acquisition of customers like these.",
